  "context": "## xSeil 2016 to 2018 Provenance Delivery and Code Evidence\nThis evidence gateway reconstructs how xSeil moved from the 2016 process and architecture baseline into 2017 development, formal validation and handover, operating artifacts, and registered code archives preserved in 2018. It connects requirements, correspondence, GitLab history, source mechanisms, operational data and registration records so that the functional, routing, orchestration and quantum-research papers can build on a shared, traceable provenance base. The article documents evidence custody and mechanism-level traceability; it does not independently validate every historical performance or impact claim.\n\nPrivate correspondence is cited through stable Gmail message and thread IDs. The linked public evidence files provide the supporting repository identifiers, hashes and registration records.\nTags: Evidence, provenance and attribution 70.83%; Mobility and infrastructure 29.17%\nCard: https://dakleyer.github.io/perspective-beyond/sources/xseil-2016-to-2018-provenance-delivery-and-code-evidence-n1876/\nSource document: https://jubap.net/xseil-2016-to-2018-provenance-delivery-and-code-evidence/\n\n",
